---
const founder = {
  handle: 'aljagne',
  role: 'Creator & Lead Architect',
  avatar: 'https://github.com/aljagne.png?size=240',
  github: 'https://github.com/aljagne',
  twitter: 'https://twitter.com/aljagne',
};
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-14 overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl">
      <!-- Decorative quote mark -->
      <span class="absolute -top-6 left-8 text-[10rem] leading-none text-moro-500/10 font-serif select-none pointer-events-none">"</span>

      <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="relative shrink-0">
          <img
            src={founder.avatar}
            alt={`Portrait of ${founder.handle}`}
            class="w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl ring-2 ring-moro-500/40 shadow-lg shadow-moro-500/20 object-cover bg-dark-800"
            loading="lazy"
            onerror="this.src='https://avatar.vercel.sh/aljagne'"
          />
          <div class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-moro-500/20 border border-moro-500/40 text-[10px] font-semibold text-moro-300 backdrop-blur-md">
            Founder
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed font-light">
            I started MoroAI in 2026 after watching a hospital IT team abandon a project that would
            have saved clinicians hours every day — not because the model failed, but
            because legal would never let patient data leave the building.
            <span class="text-white font-normal block mt-2">
              That dead end became the thesis: privacy isn't a feature you bolt on.
              It's the foundation you build on.
            </span>
          </p>

          <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-moro-500/60 via-purple-500/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <a href={founder.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block text-white font-semibold hover:text-moro-400 transition-colors">
                @{founder.handle}
              </a>
              <span class="block text-sm text-gray-400">{founder.role} · MoroAI</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-3 justify-end pt-1">
            <a
              href={founder.github}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-dark-800/80 border border-dark-700 text-gray-300 hover:text-white hover:border-moro-500/50 hover:bg-dark-700 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5"
            >
              <span>GitHub</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href={founder.twitter}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-dark-800/80 border border-dark-700 text-gray-300 hover:text-white hover:border-moro-500/50 hover:bg-dark-700 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5"
            >
              <span>Twitter / X</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
